WEBVTT

00:00:22.551 --> 00:00:23.551
Queenie.

00:00:28.599 --> 00:00:29.849
Queenie, honey.

00:00:32.853 --> 00:00:35.438
Don't. Don't move.

00:00:43.155 --> 00:00:44.281
(SPEAKING FRENCH)

00:00:45.825 --> 00:00:47.701
Yes, this is Leta Lestrange.

00:00:51.789 --> 00:00:53.915
And, uh, I'm her...

00:00:54.083 --> 00:00:55.208
Fiancé.

00:00:55.334 --> 00:00:56.418
(TINA CLEARS THROAT)

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:02.173
Thank you.

00:01:04.302 --> 00:01:05.385
(SWITCH CLICKS)

00:01:14.186 --> 00:01:15.979
Tina, about that fiancée business...

00:01:16.147 --> 00:01:18.356
Oh, sorry. Yeah, I should have
congratulated you.

00:01:18.524 --> 00:01:20.191
- No, that's...
<i>- Lumos.</i>

00:01:23.112 --> 00:01:24.446
Lestrange.

00:01:31.287 --> 00:01:32.746
Tina, about Leta...

00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:34.873
Yes, I've just said I am happy for you.

00:01:35.041 --> 00:01:37.417
No, I don't... Please, don't be happy.

00:01:39.628 --> 00:01:41.212
No. Sorry. I don't...

00:01:42.298 --> 00:01:44.090
- Obviously, I...
- (CLATTERS)

00:01:44.175 --> 00:01:45.842
Obviously, I want you to be...

00:01:46.761 --> 00:01:50.180
And I hear that you are now.
Which is wonderful.

00:01:51.766 --> 00:01:54.684
Sorry, what I'm trying to say is,
I want you to be happy,

00:01:54.769 --> 00:01:57.645
but I don't want you to be happy
that I'm happy, because I'm not.

00:02:00.983 --> 00:02:02.609
- Happy.
- (SCOFFS)

00:02:03.069 --> 00:02:04.277
Or engaged.

00:02:06.155 --> 00:02:08.198
- What?
- It was a mistake in a stupid magazine.

00:02:08.282 --> 00:02:10.158
My brother's marrying Leta,
June the 6th.

00:02:10.326 --> 00:02:11.951
I'm supposed to be best man,

00:02:12.828 --> 00:02:14.746
which is sort of mildly hilarious.

00:02:15.873 --> 00:02:17.957
Does he think you're here
to win her back?

00:02:20.961 --> 00:02:22.379
Are you here to win her back?

00:02:22.546 --> 00:02:23.880
No, I'm here...

00:02:28.135 --> 00:02:30.345
You know, your eyes really are...

00:02:33.182 --> 00:02:34.516
Are what?

00:02:35.559 --> 00:02:37.185
I'm not supposed to say.

00:02:41.190 --> 00:02:42.315
- I cut a picture of you...
- Newt, I read your book and...

00:02:42.483 --> 00:02:43.983
- Wait, did you read...
- Did you?

00:02:49.824 --> 00:02:50.907
I cut this, um...

00:02:51.951 --> 00:02:54.744
It's just a picture of you
from the paper,

00:02:55.413 --> 00:02:58.081
but it's interesting
'cause your eyes in newsprint...

00:03:00.334 --> 00:03:03.586
See, in reality they have
this effect in them, Tina. It's like...

00:03:04.255 --> 00:03:06.965
It's like fire in water, in dark water.

00:03:10.511 --> 00:03:12.512
And I've only ever seen that...

00:03:15.141 --> 00:03:17.600
I've only ever seen that in...

00:03:19.103 --> 00:03:20.437
(STAMMERING)

00:03:21.814 --> 00:03:23.231
Salamanders.

00:03:25.776 --> 00:03:26.776
- (DOOR OPENS)
- (GASPS)

00:03:27.736 --> 00:03:28.736
Come.

00:03:34.577 --> 00:03:35.577
LETA: Lestrange.

00:03:40.749 --> 00:03:41.791
Whoa!

00:04:19.205 --> 00:04:20.330
(LETA READING)

00:04:32.718 --> 00:04:33.718
(PICKETT CHITTERS)

00:04:39.183 --> 00:04:40.433
<i>Circumrota.</i>

00:04:51.487 --> 00:04:52.570
Hello, Newt.

00:04:57.201 --> 00:04:58.326
Hello, Leta.

00:05:02.623 --> 00:05:03.623
Hi.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.626
(CREATURES GROWLING)

00:05:06.877 --> 00:05:08.002
NEWT: Oh, no.

00:05:10.589 --> 00:05:11.923
(GROWLING CONTINUES)

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:14.759
TINA: What kind of cats are those?

00:05:14.927 --> 00:05:16.052
NEWT: Uh, these aren't cats.

00:05:16.136 --> 00:05:18.346
They're Matagots.
They're spirit familiars.

00:05:18.472 --> 00:05:20.223
- They guard the Ministry.
- (GROWLING)

00:05:20.432 --> 00:05:21.891
But they won't hurt you unless you...

00:05:22.059 --> 00:05:23.393
<i>Stupefy!</i>

00:05:24.603 --> 00:05:25.645
Unless you attack them.

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:27.480
Oops.

00:05:27.856 --> 00:05:29.482
- Leta.
- LETA: Reverte.

00:05:30.484 --> 00:05:31.484
(SNARLING)

00:05:38.325 --> 00:05:39.325
(BOTH HISS)

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:53.506
(ROARING)

00:05:55.718 --> 00:05:56.718
<i>Accio!</i>

00:06:04.101 --> 00:06:05.184
(GRUNTING)

00:06:08.355 --> 00:06:09.397
<i>Ascendio!</i>

